  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.51 - AM011 nested per-property code-fix submenu\n\n            Changed:\n            - When 2+ required destination properties are unmapped on one CreateMap, AM011 now collapses the per-property scaffold/ignore actions under a single \"Fix individual required property…\" submenu (each property grouped under its own entry), alongside the aggregate \"Map all / Ignore all\" actions. This keeps the lightbulb to three top-level entries instead of one per property. The single-unmapped-property case is unchanged (flat scaffold + ignore).\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - Analyzer and test projects build clean under -warnaserror (the release gate)\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.50 - AM011 aggregate Map all / Ignore all code-fix actions",
